Z||000000||Formula||04-27-2001||10:27 AM||||I saw a maroon 86-87 GT in the burg yesterday.  Actually I didnt see it at first but Jessica was like a red little older sports car with a big wing went into the bank over there.  So I hurried up and switched lanes and flew torwards the bank.  I also recieved the comment :just like a man." heheh.  anyways, I said "thats a fiero with a raised wing!"<P>I went over to park next to the guy and talk but he was either in a hurry or thought that my viper red 88 formula with aluminum wheels wasnt worthy of his presence  (probably thought it was a coupe).  So he just kind of blew me off.  when I looked at it for a second from the back it looked good, it had a neat looking hood scoop, a raised wing, and looked lowered.  it had a nice fiero 2.8 gt sound to it too.  When I pulled up next to it I didnt see any major mods on the side, but maybe a few stickers.  from the front it had a HUGE yokohama sticker (ughh, ugly tires  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">) on the nose and black headlights (cool).  it had cool looking hood scoops. the back stickers said sunoco racing fuel (ughh, sounded stck too).  <P>Overall, I'd have to say if he lost the stickers then the car would be cool, it needs a coat of paint but otherwise I like the scoops....it had tinted quarter windows too which looked really good.<P>I wanted to try to get him on the forum but I'll have to find him when he has some time, he might just be an awesome fiberglass man!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
